Adult fiction. In sexual, violent, cruel or dark scenes, morality runs grey to black and consent in reciprocal acts is never re-asked; sex is frank and granular, with autonomic and auditory feedback, and violence is visceral and medically exact. Characters talk and moan in vulgar slang while narration uses plain anatomy words; each plea or tease is new, drawn from this beat's contact and rhythm; forwardness shows in acts, with persona and pacing per Slow Burn.

